de the brief she already wears. Nothing new to learn — just one extra layer, placed exactly where it matters.</p><div data-pf-type="FlexBlock" class="sc-gplwNw dFxOVJ pf-171_"><div data-pf-type="FlexBlock" class="sc-gplwNw dFxOVJ pf-172_"><img alt="new.png__PID:6e99be2a-1506-4a43-bfce-5a43b153fdcb" src="https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0719/6888/2915/files/new.png?v=1778223612&width=2048" srcSet="https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0719/6888/2915/files/new.png?v=1778223612&width=375 375w,https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0719/6888/2915/files/new.png?v=1778223612&width=550 550w,https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0719/6888/2915/files/new.png?v=1778223612&width=768 768w,https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0719/6888/2915/files/new.png?v=1778223612&width=1024 1024w,https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0719/6888/2915/files/new.png?v=1778223612&width=1280 1280w,https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0719/6888/2915/files/new.png?v=1778223612&width=1440 1440w,https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0719/6888/2915/files/new.png?v=1778223612&width=1680 1680w,https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0719/6888/2915/files/new.png?v=1778223612&width=1800 1800w,https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0719/6888/2915/files/new.png?v=1778223612&width=1920 1920w,https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0719/6888/2915/files/new.png?v=1778223612&width=2048 2048w" fetchPriority="low" decoding="async" loading="lazy" style="--pf-image-ratio:0.9759358288770054" sizes="75vw" data-pf-type="Image5" class="sc-bhqpXc hjZSzc pf-173_ pf-image-1" store="[object Object]"/><p class="sc-cpgywQ iwOmxS pf-174_ pf-text-1" data-pf-type="Paragraph3">Take your shield and <b>remove the adhesive strip</b> on the back.</p></div><div data-pf-type="FlexBlock" class="sc-gplwNw dFxOVJ pf-176_"><img alt="instructions1 1.png__PID:2a66ee2e-c54e-4bd4-93fb-3ef05a0d5b90" src="https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0719/6888/2915/files/instructions1_1.png?v=1778223663&width=2048" srcSet="https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0719/6888/2915/files/instructions1_1.png?v=1778223663&width=375 375w,https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0719/6888/2915/files/instructions1_1.png?v=1778223663&width=550 550w,https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0719/6888/2915/files/instructions1_1.png?v=1778223663&width=768 768w,https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0719/6888/2915/files/instructions1_1.png?v=1778223663&width=1024 1024w,https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0719/6888/2915/files/instructions1_1.png?v=1778223663&width=1280 1280w,https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0719/6888/2915/files/instructions1_1.png?v=1778223663&width=1440 1440w,https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0719/6888/2915/files/instructions1_1.png?v=1778223663&width=1680 1680w,https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0719/6888/2915/files/instructions1_1.png?v=1778223663&width=1800 1800w,https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0719/6888/2915/files/instructions1_1.png?v=1778223663&width=1920 1920w,https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0719/6888/2915/files/instructions1_1.png?v=1778223663&width=2048 2048w" fetchPriority="low" decoding="async" loading="lazy" style="--pf-image-ratio:0.9707446808510638" sizes="75vw" data-pf-type="Image5" class="sc-bhqpXc hjZSzc pf-177_ pf-image-1" store="[object Object]"/><p class="sc-cpgywQ iwOmxS pf-178_ pf-text-1" data-pf-type="Paragraph3">Blue rectangle facing up and pointing toward her. Place the shield at the front of the brief, where urine exits the body.</p></div><div data-pf-type="FlexBlock" class="sc-gplwNw dFxOVJ pf-180_"><img alt="Instructions2 2.png__PID:ea672cbf-b0b7-4383-9549-06b5c6bc1d95" src="https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0719/6888/2915/files/Instructions2_2.png?v=1778224028&width=2048" srcSet="https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0719/6888/2915/files/Instructions2_2.png?v=1778224028&width=375 375w,https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0719/6888/2915/files/Instructions2_2.png?v=1778224028&width=550 550w,https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0719/6888/2915/files/Instructions2_2.png?v=1778224028&width=768 768w,https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0719/6888/2915/files/Instructions2_2.png?v=1778224028&width=1024 1024w,https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0719/6888/2915/files/Instructions2_2.png?v=1778224028&width=1280 1280w,https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0719/6888/2915/files/Instructions2_2.png?v=1778224028&width=1440 1440w,https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0719/6888/2915/files/Instructions2_2.png?v=1778224028&width=1680 1680w,https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0719/6888/2915/files/Instructions2_2.png?v=1778224028&width=1800 1800w,https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0719/6888/2915/files/Instructions2_2.png?v=1778224028&width=1920 1920w,https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0719/6888/2915/files/Instructions2_2.png?v=1778224028&width=2048 2048w" fetchPriority="low" decoding="async" loading="lazy" style="--pf-image-ratio:0.9708222811671088" sizes="75vw" data-pf-type="Image5" class="sc-bhqpXc hjZSzc pf-181_ pf-image-1" store="[object Object]"/><p class="sc-cpgywQ iwOmxS pf-182_ pf-text-1" data-pf-type="Paragraph3"><b>Press the shield</b> down gently to ensure a snug fit.</p></div><div data-pf-type="FlexBlock" class="sc-gplwNw dFxOVJ pf-184_"><img alt="Instructions2 1.png__PID:62b4dd4e-7da2-4fdd-8256-91f42c3610b1" src="https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0719/6888/2915/files/Instructions2_1.png?v=1778224097&width=2048" srcSet="https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0719/6888/2915/files/Instructions2_1.png?v=1778224097&width=375 375w,https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0719/6888/2915/files/Instructions2_1.png?v=1778224097&width=550 550w,https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0719/6888/2915/files/Instructions2_1.png?v=1778224097&width=768 768w,https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0719/6888/2915/files/Instructions2_1.png?v=1778224097&width=1024 1024w,https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0719/6888/2915/files/Instructions2_1.png?v=1778224097&width=1280 1280w,https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0719/6888/2915/files/Instructions2_1.png?v=1778224097&width=1440 1440w,https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0719/6888/2915/files/Instructions2_1.png?v=1778224097&width=1680 1680w,https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0719/6888/2915/files/Instructions2_1.png?v=1778224097&width=1800 1800w,https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0719/6888/2915/files/Instructions2_1.png?v=1778224097&width=1920 1920w,https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0719/6888/2915/files/Instructions2_1.png?v=1778224097&width=2048 2048w" fetchPriority="low" decoding="async" loading="lazy" style="--pf-image-ratio:0.976" sizes="75vw" data-pf-type="Image5" class="sc-bhqpXc hjZSzc pf-185_ pf-image-1" store="[object Object]"/><p class="sc-cpgywQ iwOmxS pf-186_ pf-text-1" data-pf-type="Paragraph3">Toss the used shield with her brief at each change, and place a fresh one.</p></div></div><a data-to-section="pf-0b9f" data-offset="{&quot;all&quot;:50,&quot;laptop&quot;:50,&quot;tablet&quot;:50,&quot;mobile&quot;:50}" href="#" data-pf-type="Button2" class="sc-dGHlFg faKnnT pf-188_ pf-button-1">Protect Her Today</a></div></section><section data-section-id="pf-ddd9" data-pf-type="FlexSection" class="sc-bWJTsT icavsd pf-190_ pf-container-1 pf-color-scheme-1"><div class="sc-fscnvs hZOWUC pf-flex-section"><div data-pf-type="FlexBlock" class="sc-gplwNw dFxOVJ pf-191_"><h2 data-pf-type="Heading2" class="sc-eIceNc cJLiOo pf-192_ pf-heading-1-h2">The questions every daughter asks first.</h2></div><div data-pf-type="FlexBlock" class="sc-gplwNw dFxOVJ pf-194_"><div class="sc-sasBe kBTmPC pf-195_ pf-icon-right" data-scroll-to-top="true" data-open-multiple="true" data-pf-type="Accordion3"><details class="sc-eNSrbD ipZhjo pf-196_" data-pf-type="Accordion3.Content.Wrapper"><summary><div class="sc-dWZrec bgMVut pf-197_ pf-anchor pf-header-item-wrapper" data-header-id="d5afe012-89be-4dbd-9e26-f7d2123ec35d" data-active="false" data-pf-type="Accordion3.Header"><svg class="pf-accordion-icon pfa-chevron-right pfa-arrow" style="width:auto;fill:currentcolor" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" viewBox="0 0 320 512"><path d="M278.6 233.4c12.5 12.5 12.5 32.8 0 45.3l-160 160c-12.5 12.5-32.8 12.5-45.3 0s-12.5-32.8 0-45.3L210.7 256 73.4 118.6c-12.5-12.5-12.5-32.8 0-45.3s32.8-12.5 45.3 0l160 160z"></path></svg><span><strong>Can she put it in herself, or do I have to do it for her?</strong></span></div></summary><div class="sc-isRpEB hHtkde pf-199_ pf-accordion-body" data-pf-expandable="true" data-pf-type="Accordion3.Content"><div class="pf-accordion-display-content"><div data-pf-type="Accordion3.Flex.Content" class="sc-hXCwer fSFwsi pf-200_"><p class="sc-fWORJz ekBzGm pf-201_ pf-text-1" data-pf-type="Paragraph4"><span class="pf-paragraph-content ">She can, in most cases. UraGuard® is a single shield with an adhesive strip on the back — she peels, places, and presses, the same motion as a liner. For someone managing her own briefs today, this changes nothing about her routine and nobody else has to be involved. If you're already helping with changes, it adds about ten seconds.</span></p></div></div></div></details><details class="sc-eNSrbD ipZhjo pf-204_" data-pf-type="Accordion3.Content.Wrapper"><summary><div class="sc-dWZrec bgMVut pf-205_ pf-anchor pf-header-item-wrapper" data-header-id="40797c7c-5622-4cd7-94be-f17b58186a81" data-active="false" data-pf-type="Accordion3.Header"><svg class="pf-accordion-icon pfa-chevron-right pfa-arrow" style="width:auto;fill:currentcolor" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" viewBox="0 0 320 512"><path d="M278.6 233.4c12.5 12.5 12.5 32.8 0 45.3l-160 160c-12.5 12.5-32.8 12.5-45.3 0s-12.5-32.8 0-45.3L210.7 256 73.4 118.6c-12.5-12.5-12.5-32.8 0-45.3s32.8-12.5 45.3 0l160 160z"></path></svg><span><strong>Does it reduce the absorbency of her brief?</strong></span></div></summary><div class="sc-isRpEB hHtkde pf-207_ pf-accordion-body" data-pf-expandable="true" data-pf-type="Accordion3.Content"><div class="pf-accordion-display-content"><div data-pf-type="Accordion3.Flex.Content" class="sc-hXCwer fSFwsi pf-208_"><p class="sc-fWORJz ekBzGm pf-209_ pf-text-1" data-pf-type="Paragraph4"><span class="pf-paragraph-content ">No. UraGuard® is a thin barrier shield — not an additional absorbency layer. Moisture passes through into her incontinence product as normal. The difference is that there is now a physical barrier between that product and her skin, reducing bacterial contact at the urethral area.</span></p></div></div></div></details><details class="sc-eNSrbD ipZhjo pf-212_ pf-lg-hide pf-md-hide pf-sm-hide pf-hide" data-pf-type="Accordion3.Content.Wrapper"><summary><div class="sc-dWZrec bgMVut pf-213_ pf-anchor pf-header-item-wrapper" data-header-id="ea76cb55-4693-44b2-921d-6ce03730661d" data-active="false" data-pf-type="Accordion3.Header"><svg class="pf-accordion-icon pfa-chevron-right pfa-arrow" style="width:auto;fill:currentcolor" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" viewBox="0 0 320 512"><path d="M278.6 233.4c12.5 12.5 12.5 32.8 0 45.3l-160 160c-12.5 12.5-32.8 12.5-45.3 0s-12.5-32.8 0-45.3L210.7 256 73.4 118.6c-12.5-12.5-12.5-32.8 0-45.3s32.8-12.5 45.3 0l160 160z"></path></svg><span><strong>Will it shift or bunch during the day?</strong></span></div></summary><div class="sc-isRpEB hHtkde pf-215_ pf-accordion-body" data-pf-expandable="true" data-pf-type="Accordion3.Content"><div class="pf-accordion-display-content"><div data-pf-type="Accordion3.Flex.Content" class="sc-hXCwer fSFwsi pf-216_"><p class="sc-fWORJz ekBzGm pf-217_ pf-text-1" data-pf-type="Paragraph4"><span class="pf-paragraph-content ">UraGuard® is designed to stay in place throughout the day. Its thin, flexible, contoured construction moves with your body. It is skin-safe and discreet. In fact, most users report forgetting it is there within the first week of use.</span></p></div></div></div></details><details class="sc-eNSrbD ipZhjo pf-220_ pf-lg-hide pf-md-hide pf-sm-hide pf-hide" data-pf-type="Accordion3.Content.Wrapper"><summary><div class="sc-dWZrec bgMVut pf-221_ pf-anchor pf-header-item-wrapper" data-header-id="49eb1beb-588e-4b97-9afd-b762ec01b94d" data-active="false" data-pf-type="Accordion3.Header"><svg class="pf-accordion-icon pfa-chevron-right pfa-arrow" style="width:auto;fill:currentcolor" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" viewBox="0 0 320 512"><path d="M278.6 233.4c12.5 12.5 12.5 32.8 0 45.3l-160 160c-12.5 12.5-32.8 12.5-45.3 0s-12.5-32.8 0-45.3L210.7 256 73.4 118.6c-12.5-12.5-12.5-32.8 0-45.3s32.8-12.5 45.3 0l160 160z"></path></svg><span><strong>How often should I replace it?</strong></span></div></summary><div class="sc-isRpEB hHtkde pf-223_ pf-accordion-body" data-pf-expandable="true" data-pf-type="Accordion3.Content"><div class="pf-accordion-display-content"><div data-pf-type="Accordion3.Flex.Content" class="sc-hXCwer fSFwsi pf-224_"><p class="sc-fWORJz ekBzGm pf-225_ pf-text-1" data-pf-type="Paragraph4"><span class="pf-paragraph-content ">Replace UraGuard®&nbsp;whenever you change your incontinence product. Each shield is designed for single-session use. Lab testing confirms it maintains its protective barrier for 8+ hours, so for most women this means two to four shields per day depending on your routine.</span></p></div></div></div></details><details class="sc-eNSrbD ipZhjo pf-228_ pf-lg-hide pf-md-hide pf-sm-hide pf-hide" data-pf-type="Accordion3.Content.Wrapper"><summary><div class="sc-dWZrec bgMVut pf-229_ pf-anchor pf-header-item-wrapper" data-header-id="9e83dee2-6ac6-4a81-b9d7-e7e5da487201" data-active="false" data-pf-type="Accordion3.Header"><svg class="pf-accordion-icon pfa-chevron-right pfa-arrow" style="width:auto;fill:currentcolor" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" viewBox="0 0 320 512"><path d="M278.6 233.4c12.5 12.5 12.5 32.8 0 45.3l-160 160c-12.5 12.5-32.8 12.5-45.3 0s-12.5-32.8 0-45.3L210.7 256 73.4 118.6c-12.5-12.5-12.5-32.8 0-45.3s32.8-12.5 45.3 0l160 160z"></path></svg><span><strong>Is UraGuard® available as a pull-up or tabbed diaper?</strong></span></div></summary><div class="sc-isRpEB hHtkde pf-231_ pf-accordion-body" data-pf-expandable="true" data-pf-type="Accordion3.Content"><div class="pf-accordion-display-content"><div data-pf-type="Accordion3.Flex.Content" class="sc-hXCwer fSFwsi pf-232_"><p class="sc-fWORJz ekBzGm pf-233_ pf-text-1" data-pf-type="Paragraph4"><span class="pf-paragraph-content ">Currently, UraGuard® is available as a shield insert allowing you to add our anti-bacterial protective benefits to any existing incontinence product. However, we understand the need for an all-in-one solution, and we are actively exploring pull-up and tabbed-style options. Stay tuned for updates!</span></p></div></div></div></details><details class="sc-eNSrbD ipZhjo pf-236_" data-pf-type="Accordion3.Content.Wrapper"><summary><div class="sc-dWZrec bgMVut pf-237_ pf-anchor pf-header-item-wrapper" data-header-id="b1f3c0f3-e29f-4852-8737-8ec7ab9e33ea" data-active="false" data-pf-type="Accordion3.Header"><svg class="pf-accordion-icon pfa-chevron-right pfa-arrow" style="width:auto;fill:currentcolor" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" viewBox="0 0 320 512"><path d="M278.6 233.4c12.5 12.5 12.5 32.8 0 45.3l-160 160c-12.5 12.5-32.8 12.5-45.3 0s-12.5-32.8 0-45.3L210.7 256 73.4 118.6c-12.5-12.5-12.5-32.8 0-45.3s32.8-12.5 45.3 0l160 160z"></path></svg><span><strong>Will she notice it, or pull at it?</strong></span></div></summary><div class="sc-isRpEB hHtkde pf-239_ pf-accordion-body" data-pf-expandable="true" data-pf-type="Accordion3.Content"><div class="pf-accordion-display-content"><div data-pf-type="Accordion3.Flex.Content" class="sc-hXCwer fSFwsi pf-240_"><p class="sc-fWORJz ekBzGm pf-241_ pf-text-1" data-pf-type="Paragraph4"><span class="pf-paragraph-content ">It sits flat inside the brief against the absorbent core, not loose against her skin, and it's made of the same soft topsheet material she's already wearing — so there's nothing new to feel and nothing loose to catch on. If she already pulls at her briefs themselves, UraGuard® won't change that, and it's worth raising with her care team.</span></p></div></div></div></details><details class="sc-eNSrbD ipZhjo pf-244_" data-pf-type="Accordion3.Content.Wrapper"><summary><div class="sc-dWZrec bgMVut pf-245_ pf-anchor pf-header-item-wrapper" data-header-id="481c7e20-e088-434f-91b0-538c373c01ed" data-active="false" data-pf-type="Accordion3.Header"><svg class="pf-accordion-icon pfa-chevron-right pfa-arrow" style="width:auto;fill:currentcolor" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" viewBox="0 0 320 512"><path d="M278.6 233.4c12.5 12.5 12.5 32.8 0 45.3l-160 160c-12.5 12.5-32.8 12.5-45.3 0s-12.5-32.8 0-45.3L210.7 256 73.4 118.6c-12.5-12.5-12.5-32.8 0-45.3s32.8-12.5 45.3 0l160 160z"></path></svg><span><strong>Can I ship it straight to her, or to her facility? And can I set it on a schedule?</strong></span></div></summary><div class="sc-isRpEB hHtkde pf-247_ pf-accordion-body" data-pf-expandable="true" data-pf-type="Accordion3.Content"><div class="pf-accordion-display-content"><div data-pf-type="Accordion3.Flex.Content" class="sc-hXCwer fSFwsi pf-248_"><p class="sc-fWORJz ekBzGm pf-249_ pf-text-1" data-pf-type="Paragraph4"><span class="pf-paragraph-content ">Yes — enter her address, or her facility's, as the shipping address at checkout while paying on your own card. You can buy UraGuard® as a one-time purchase or subscribe to save, so it arrives on a schedule and doesn't become one more thing on your list. If you subscribe: billing is monthly, you can cancel before your next charge with no penalty, and there are no hidden fees. All terms are shown clearly at checkout before you confirm. UraGuard® is also HSA/FSA eligible.</span></p></div></div></div></details></div></div></div></section><section data-section-id="pf-749a" data-pf-type="FlexSection" class="sc-bWJTsT icavsd pf-252_ pf-container-1 pf-color-scheme-1 pf-lg-hide pf-md-hide pf-sm-hide pf-hide"><div class="sc-fscnvs hZOWUC pf-flex-section"><p class="sc-cpgywQ iwOmxS pf-253_ pf-text-1" data-pf-type="Paragraph3">You can't be there for every change. UraGuard®&nbsp;can.</p><p class="sc-cpgywQ iwOmxS pf-255_ pf-text-1 pf-lg-hide" data-pf-type="Paragraph3"><em><strong></strong><strong></strong>“I believe this is going to be a good fit with my mom to decrease the chance of her getting another UTI”</em></p><div data-pf-type="FlexBlock" class="sc-gplwNw dFxOVJ pf-257_ pf-lg-hide"><div data-pf-type="FlexBlock" class="sc-gplwNw dFxOVJ pf-258_"><div data-pf-type="HTML.Video3" class="sc-fyVeKD giqCkC pf-259_"><div class="pf-lazy-html-video pf-video-wrapper"><video data-src="https://cdn.shopify.com/videos/c/o/v/1de9922106474e53a8c2f4835a1b610f.mp4#t=0.1" data-autoplay="false" data-lazyloading="lazy" width="100%" class="pf-visibility-hidden pf-media-video" type="video/1" controlsList="nodownload" disablepictureinpicture=""></video><svg class="pf-play-button" width="64" height="64" viewBox="0 0 48 48"><path d="M24.0003 47.8334C37.1631 47.8334 47.8337 37.1629 47.8337 24.0001C47.8337 10.8373 37.1631 0.166748 24.0003
