"sc-eIceNc cJLiOo pf-281_ pf-heading-1-h1">She protected you. <br>Now protect her.</h1><h2 data-pf-type="Heading2" class="sc-eIceNc cJLiOo pf-283_ pf-heading-1-h2 pf-hide">Her brief holds bacteria against her skin for hours. That's where UTIs start.</h2><h2 data-pf-type="Heading2" class="sc-eIceNc cJLiOo pf-285_ pf-heading-1-h2">UraGuard® is a small shield that goes inside the brief she already wears — and helps block bacteria before they reach her.</h2><div data-pf-type="FlexBlock" class="sc-gplwNw dFxOVJ pf-287_"><div data-pf-type="FlexBlock" class="sc-gplwNw dFxOVJ pf-288_"><a data-to-section="pf-0b9f" data-offset="{&quot;all&quot;:50,&quot;laptop&quot;:50,&quot;tablet&quot;:50,&quot;mobile&quot;:50}" href="#" data-pf-type="Button2" class="sc-dGHlFg faKnnT pf-289_ pf-button-1">Protect Her Today</a></div><div data-pf-type="FlexBlock" class="sc-gplwNw dFxOVJ pf-292_"><a data-to-section="pf-b489" data-offset="{&quot;all&quot;:50,&quot;laptop&quot;:50,&quot;tablet&quot;:50,&quot;mobile&quot;:50}" href="#" data-pf-type="Button2" class="sc-dGHlFg faKnnT pf-293_ pf-button-1">See How It Works &gt;</a></div></div><p class="sc-cpgywQ iwOmxS pf-296_ pf-text-1" data-pf-type="Paragraph3">30-day money-back guarantee · HSA/FSA eligible</p></div><div data-pf-type="FlexBlock" class="sc-gplwNw dFxOVJ pf-298_"><img alt="Diapers hold bacteria from waste. UraGuard blocks it from reaching you. copy 3.png__PID:bbdd715c-7c63-4eec-b342-0f44b0128fcd" src="https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0719/6888/2915/files/Diapers_hold_bacteria_from_waste._UraGuard_blocks_it_from_reaching_you._copy_3.png?v=1788915409&width=2048" srcSet="https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0719/6888/2915/files/Diapers_hold_bacteria_from_waste._UraGuard_blocks_it_from_reaching_you._copy_3.png?v=1788915409&width=375 375w,https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0719/6888/2915/files/Diapers_hold_bacteria_from_waste._UraGuard_blocks_it_from_reaching_you._copy_3.png?v=1788915409&width=550 550w,https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0719/6